---
import { uiIcon } from "../../site/identity";
---

<section class="section wrap" id="services">
  <div class="section-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">MAKE ROOM FOR WHAT MATTERS</p>
    <h2>
      Your money should
      <br /> support your life.
    </h2>
    <p>
      You don’t need to have it all figured out. Start with what’s on your mind,
      and build a plan around what matters to you.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="services">
    <article>
      <span class="service-number icon-label">
        <Fragment set:html={uiIcon("wallet")} />
        01 / EVERYDAY CLARITY
      </span>
      <h3>
        Know where your
        <br /> money is going.
      </h3>
      <p>
        Bring income and expenses into focus with a personalized budget you can
        actually use.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact/?goal=budget">Build a better budget</a>
    </article>

    <article>
      <span class="service-number icon-label">
        <Fragment set:html={uiIcon("debt")} />
        02 / A WAY FORWARD
      </span>
      <h3>
        Give your debt
        <br /> a game plan.
      </h3>
      <p>
        Put your balances in perspective and work toward a payoff plan that fits
        your priorities.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact/?goal=debt">Make a debt plan</a>
    </article>

    <article>
      <span class="service-number icon-label">
        <Fragment set:html={uiIcon("target")} />
        03 / THE BIGGER PICTURE
      </span>
      <h3>
        Turn “someday”
        <br /> into next steps.
      </h3>
      <p>
        Connect your day-to-day decisions to longer-term goals, with support
        along the way.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact/?goal=goals">Focus on your goals</a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
